# Blast from the Past (windurst 11): 214's option below 0. Star Struck completed by GM, fame 125: 214 finished with option
# -1 (the client's 0xFFFFFFFF: not 0, nothing, still available), then option 0 (begun). #guard takes options 1 and 2.
lists WindurstWalls/Koru-Moru/onTrigger WindurstWalls/onEventFinish/214
char zone=WindurstWalls pos=-120.2,-5.5,122.4 lvl=75
fame Windurst 125
quest Windurst.StarStruck completed
login
trigger Koru-Moru                              # 214
finish option=-1                               # not 0: nothing (still available)
trigger Koru-Moru                              # 214 again
finish option=0                                # begun
trigger Koru-Moru                              # accepted, Option 0: 216
finish
